WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.700
In the very first chapter of One Piece, Shanks
sacrifices his arm and gives the 7-year-old

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.160
Luffy his straw hat.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.920
This is to inspire Luffy to become king of
the pirates.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:13.559
At the same time, Luffy begs Shanks to let
him join the Red Hair Pirates.

00:00:13.559 --> 00:00:19.381
But Shanks refuses so Luffy can create his
own crew 10 years later, when he is 17, which

00:00:19.381 --> 00:00:21.730
kicks off the story that we know today.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:25.620
But this makes us wonder: What would have
happened if Shanks had actually let Luffy

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.700
join his crew?

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:31.410
What if instead of creating the Straw Hats,
Luffy had become a Red Hair Pirate?

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.640
Our story of course starts right at the beginning
of One Piece, when Luffy meets Shanks for

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.790
the very first time.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:40.430
Luffy and Shanks are the exact same people
as in the main story line.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:46.020
The only thing that needs to change, is that
Luffy actually gets to join the crew before

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.510
the Red Hair pirates leave his village.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:52.820
So why doesn’t Shanks allow Luffy to join?

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:59.059
He actually gives us not 1, but 3 reasons:
Because Luffy can’t swim, because he is

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:02.840
too young and because the pirate life is still
too dangerous.

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:07.390
But I don’t think any of these are the real
reason.

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.510
Shanks himself was found by the first pirate
king Gol D. Roger as a baby.

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:18.010
So Shanks was part of one of the most dangerous
pirate crews when he was Luffy’s age and

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:21.670
it doesn’t look like he regretted even a
single moment of it.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:28.150
And yes, Luffy can’t swim, but the same
goes for literally any Devil Fruit user ever.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:32.690
The rest of Shanks’ crew is actually very
much in favor of Luffy joining as well.

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:36.950
So, what is Shanks’ real reason to leave
Luffy behind?

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:41.690
One possibility is that Shanks literally can’t
take Luffy because he cannot swim.

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:46.500
An interesting fact about Shanks’ crew,
is that not a single one of his members has

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.390
eaten a devil fruit.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:53.490
Maybe Shanks knows a place that you can only
swim to and therefore he doesn’t allow any

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.710
non-swimmers to join.

00:01:55.710 --> 00:02:00.030
Maybe it’s because Shanks wanted to Luffy
to grow and prove himself without the help

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:01.610
of a Yonko.

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:06.040
If you have watched my past What if’s you
will know, that I strongly believe that Shanks

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:10.050
was planning for Luffy to become Pirate King
right from the start.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:14.450
Or maybe, Eiichiro Oda, the author of One
Piece, simply did it because otherwise he

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:17.780
wouldn’t have been able to write his story,
the way he wanted to.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:21.660
I am sure we will get an answer for this in
the future, but let’s assume that after

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:25.160
Luffy eats his devil fruit, Shanks changes
his mind.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:29.310
If Luffy is the one who will become pirate
king and change the world, he figures the

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:33.090
safest way to get there is by training and
protecting Luffy himself.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:36.060
Luffy is of course extremely hyped about this.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:40.110
He is now officially the cabin boy of the
Red Hair pirates.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:44.430
And form here on out the flow of the story
starts to change quite dramatically.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.780
The incident with the mountain bandits in
the bar still happens.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:52.319
Luffy is still enraged about Shanks not fighting
back, but Ben Beckman tells him that he will

00:02:52.319 --> 00:02:58.260
understand one day, puts Luffy on his shoulder
and the Red Hair pirates leave Luffy’s island

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.209
that same day.

00:03:00.209 --> 00:03:04.530
This means, that Luffy is never kidnapped
by the mountain bandits and as a result, Shanks

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:05.970
never loses his arm.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:10.920
As you probably know, Shanks actually sacrificed
his stronger arm that he used to hold his

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:11.920
sword with.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:16.220
In the main storyline, before he let the sea
king bite it off to inspire Luffy, Shanks

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:22.160
was able to fight on the same level as Dracule
Mihawk, the worlds strongest swordsman.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:29.450
So if Luffy joins Shanks’ crew, Shanks actually
keeps his legendary sword fighting abilities.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:36.000
This may seem like a pretty big change, but
it’s nothing compared to this next one.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.019
Because in this version of the story, Luffy
actually never meets the mountain bandits,

00:03:37.019 --> 00:03:38.019
nor Ace and Sabo.

00:03:38.019 --> 00:03:39.019
It is actually revealed by Oda, that Luffy’s
Grandfather Garp only brought Luffy to his

00:03:39.019 --> 00:03:40.019
bandit friend Dardan AFTER Luffy already ate
his Devil Fruit, and Shanks and his crew had

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:41.019
already left.

00:03:41.019 --> 00:03:42.019
So At this point, Luffy only knows about Ace
from his grandfather’s stories.

00:03:42.019 --> 00:03:46.970
And he only learns about Sabo, years later
when running into the revolutionary army.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:52.490
The three of them never become brothers.

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:55.500
But Ace still joins the Whitebeard pirates.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:59.579
Since Shanks didn’t save Luffy’s life
from the sea king, Luffy doesn’t get inspired

00:03:59.579 --> 00:04:00.920
to become pirate king.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:06.840
His new dream is to become the strongest pirate
in Shanks’ crew and make his captain pirate

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:07.840
king instead.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:11.939
However, just how Whitebeard was secretly
planning for Ace to find the One Piece and

00:04:11.939 --> 00:04:17.540
take over the Whitebeard pirates, Shanks is
also planning to make Luffy pirate king one

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:18.540
day.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:23.160
After all, Luffy has still eaten his unique
devil fruit and he still resembles Shanks’

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.510
former captain Roger.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:27.850
So while the Red Hair pirates are sailing
away from Luffy’s home island, and having

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:32.400
a welcome Party for their newest member, Shanks
suddenly becomes serious.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:38.009
He had purposefully sailed the ship into the
calm belt, where the giant sea kings attack

00:04:38.009 --> 00:04:40.860
any ship that tries to cross through it.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:45.860
Luffy is shocked at the giant creatures suddenly
towering over the ship.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:48.420
But Shanks has been waiting for this.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:55.570
Dark clouds appear in the sky, as the man
with the strongest conquerors haki in the

00:04:55.570 --> 00:05:01.070
world knocks out all of the giant sea monsters
with one single burst of haki.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:06.000
The planks of the ship creek under the pressure,
but Shanks, who just like Rayleigh in the

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:14.480
auction house on Sabaody, has perfect control
over his powers, has excluded the 7-year-old

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.310
Luffy.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:19.729
And Luffy looks at Shanks like he is some
sort of god.

00:05:19.729 --> 00:05:22.620
This is exactly what Shanks has been hoping
for.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:27.220
Just like in the main storyline after sacrificing
his arm, he makes Luffy promise to become

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.910
a strong pirate and surpass him one day.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:36.760
And he still gives Luffy the straw hat that
he had gotten from Roger as a kid too.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:41.289
So instead of training with Ace and Sabo in
the Djungles of his island, Luffy now grows

00:05:41.289 --> 00:05:43.060
up on Shanks’ ship.

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:48.150
He very quickly grows incredibly close to
all of the main crew members, who now raise

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:50.880
him instead of the bandits.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:54.510
There are still a lot of similarities to our
main timeline Luffy.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:57.919
He has a very similar dream, that drives him
to become stronger.

00:05:57.919 --> 00:05:59.840
He still has his straw hat.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:04.650
He still lives a life of freedom, training,
eating and sleeping under the stars.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:09.150
And he still has a strong sense of justice
and wants to help people.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.449
However, the red hair pirates aren’t mountain
bandits.

00:06:12.449 --> 00:06:18.210
A few years after joining the crew, Shanks
becomes known as one of the 4 emperors of

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.480
the sea.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:24.980
He has one of the 4 strongest pirate crews
in the world, who are now all training Luffy.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:30.350
And as you would expect, that changes how
luffy develops drastically compared to growing

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.360
up with Ace and Sabo.

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:36.800
Luffy is still able to run and good around
a lot, for example I could totally see him

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:42.860
having a great time with Monster, this monkey,
that is actually an officer.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:48.169
Shanks would of course teach Luffy all about
Haki very early on in his life, soon realizing

00:06:48.169 --> 00:06:54.889
that Luffy also has the potential to use conquerors
haki, which surprises no one in the crew.

00:06:54.889 --> 00:07:00.810
Shanks teaches Luffy how to fight with a sword,
although, just like in the actual story, I

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.560
don’t think Luffy would be great with swords.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:07.569
Instead, as you can probably tell from my
thumbnail, I think it would be really cool

00:07:07.569 --> 00:07:13.300
if Luffy got inspired by Ben Beckman and Usopp’s
father Yasopp to start using a gun.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:19.060
As we know, Luffy isn’t stupid, he just
doesn’t know much about the world because

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:23.599
he was raised by mountain bandits and running
around with his brothers all day.

00:07:23.599 --> 00:07:28.960
On board of Shanks’ ship, I think Luffy
would still be his normal freedom loving,

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:34.410
always-hungry self, but get a really good
education about all types of things.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:39.819
Geography, the different races that exist,
the balance of powers between marines, the

00:07:39.819 --> 00:07:42.120
warlords and the emperors, and so on.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:48.540
Oda has revealed after all, that Ben Beckman
is the smartest person from the east blue.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:53.500
It would be really interesting to see Luffy
take on a slightly more serious and calculating

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.729
side with his influence.

00:07:54.729 --> 00:08:03.590
And of course his outfit would look significantly
more badass than it does for most of the story.

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:08.810
And speaking of Yasopp: Not only do I see
him teaching Luffy how to use a gun and observation

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:11.550
Haki, but there is another thing I could see
happening.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:16.440
You see in the other two what if videos i
have made so far, about ‘what if luffy was

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:21.819
never born’ and ‘what if Luffy became
a marine’, a common theme is that Usopp

00:08:21.819 --> 00:08:23.449
always dies.

00:08:23.449 --> 00:08:27.560
After all, without Luffy and Zoro coming to
fight the Kuro pirates, Usopp’s village

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:31.500
is simply over-run and the entire island taken
out.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:35.970
And since people have been complaining in
the comments a LOT about killing off usopp,

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:40.310
I think we have finally found a scenario to
keep him alive.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:45.900
Because if Shanks allows Luffy to join, even
though he is too young, why shouldn’t Yasopp

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.760
get his son as well?

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:54.050
Not only did he feel very guilty for leaving
Usopp behind, but both Usopp and Luffy would

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.890
have someone their own age in the crew.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:01.220
And I’m sure Shanks would approve of that
too, considering he grew up with Buggy on

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.620
Roger’s ship.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:08.140
So in this version of the story, the Red Hair
Pirates drop by Syrup village to pick up Usopp,

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:13.840
who also goes on to become a brave warrior
of the sea and one of the most powerful fighters

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:17.850
in the world, this time growing up without
daddy issues.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:22.480
Now since there is no one with a devil fruit
in Shanks’ crew, you might think Luffy’s

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.240
devil fruit powers might get neglected.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:28.292
But if you think about it, Luffy also had
no one else with a devil fruit power around

00:09:28.292 --> 00:09:33.120
him growing up either and he still managed
to develop his skills just fine.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:38.600
In fact, Shanks and co not only have fought
with enough devil fruit users to teach Luffy

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:44.880
the basics and help him develop different
techniques, but they also know the truth about

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:47.000
this unique devil fruit.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.940
To unlock his true potential, they might tell
him about the true power of his abilities

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:53.910
or at least guide him into the right direction.

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:59.860
So I would expect Luffy to awaken his devil
fruit powers at a quite young age.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:03.860
After all, after becoming a Yonko, Shanks
would spend most of his time in the new world,

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:06.250
where he started to establish his own territories.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:13.170
So Luffy would run into skirmishes and larger
battles with other powerful pirate groups

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:17.570
all the time, giving him more and more chances
to practice his abilities.

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:23.660
This of course also includes encounters with
Big Mom, Kaido and Whitebeard.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:28.630
Especially during the latter, he befriends
Ace as a rival, since they are both from the

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:31.430
same island and have the same grandfather.

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:36.529
And once he actually awakens his devil fruit,
Shanks for the first time tells him about

00:10:36.529 --> 00:10:42.370
Laugh Tale and being part of Roger’s crew,
igniting the spark in Luffy to go see Laugh

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.029
Tale for himself.

00:10:44.029 --> 00:10:48.420
Which now brings us the time when Luffy actually
starts his adventure in the main storyline.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:11:52.570
What is going to happen to all the other straw
hats?

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:57.670
Because at this point Luffy has already become
a real monster that is well known throughout

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:03.110
the world, who has established himself as
one of Shanks’ core crew members.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:07.820
As you can imagine, without Luffy there to
save them, many of the straw hats would be

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:12.620
doomed and the east blue saga would be pretty
dark.

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:18.370
Now, you could of course say, that Luffy is
strong enough at this point to start his own

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:23.170
crew and still meets his original crew, but
way stronger.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:29.920
If you’d be interested in a video about
what that would look like, make sure to subscribe

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.490
and let me know in the comments.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:36.690
But I don’t think that it would be the natural
thing for Luffy to do at this point.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.920
But hey, at least we have saved Usopp.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:45.231
When Luffy joins Shanks’ crew, he never
gets to save Koby from Alvida’s ship. he

00:12:45.231 --> 00:12:49.470
also doesn’t make it to the Marine Base,
where Zoro is being starved to death.

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:53.660
As a result, the future strongest swordsman
in the world, doesn’t survive.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.550
At the Baratie, Sanji stays there as a cook.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:13:00.449
But I believe that the Vinsmoke family would
still find out about him sooner or later and

00:13:00.449 --> 00:13:04.100
would still try to marry him off for the alliance
with big mom.

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:08.150
As a result, Sanji gets assassinated at the
wedding party.

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:14.389
Meanwhile, Arlong steals all of Nami’s savings
and forces her to keep working as a cartographer

00:13:14.389 --> 00:13:15.760
for many more years.

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:21.720
Moving on to the grandline, here it is a lot
more likely that Luffy will encounter some

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.110
of the straw hats.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:27.790
After all, the Yonko and their crews are moving
around the grandline all the time.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:32.370
And we also know, that Shanks has been growing
his crew quite a bit as well since he first

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.010
met Luffy 10 years ago.

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:39.990
So it would not be that hard for Luffy to
convince him to let someone join.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:44.100
Luffy would definitely get to meet Crocus,
who , just like Shanks is a former member

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.589
of the Roger pirates.

00:13:45.589 --> 00:13:51.750
In the real timeline, Shanks told both Crocus
and Rayleigh about Luffy, who were waiting

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:56.340
for him at the entrance to the first and second
half of the grandline respectively.

00:13:56.340 --> 00:14:00.509
Crocus telling Luffy about Laugh Tale and
giving the crew the log pose, while Rayleigh

00:14:00.509 --> 00:14:04.889
helped Luffy train and get stronger for 2
full years.

00:14:04.889 --> 00:14:10.320
So in this version of the story, Shanks also
introduces Luffy to Crocus and Luffy gets

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.820
to meet Laboon and promises him to come back.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:15.380
Chopper really could go either way.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:20.360
It’s definitely possible, that Shanks and
co make a stop at Drum island at some point

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:26.660
and Luffy picks him up, but at the same time
he might also never go there and chopper simply

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:30.490
ends up living with Dr Kureha under Wapol’s
terrible rule.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:35.930
Robin would either stay with Crocodile, who
would most likely succeed in taking over Alabasta,

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:39.350
or Luffy might run into her at some point
and make her join.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:44.880
We don’t know if Shanks has anyone in his
crew that is capable of reading the poneglyphs,

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:49.720
but if not, Robin would be incredibly valuable.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:52.490
Enel still goes to the moon.

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.360
Pretty much no change here.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:15:00.100
Franky stays on water 7, but would probably
be discovered by Lucci and Cp0 at some point

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:03.990
during their undercover mission to get the
plans of Pluton.

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:08.389
And as usual, Brook sooner or later gets his
shadow back, when Moria is inevitably defeated

00:15:08.389 --> 00:15:11.959
at some point, and becomes a global superstar.

00:15:11.959 --> 00:15:16.190
Luffy does of course meet Rayleigh on Sabaody
Archipelago though.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:21.420
Just like with Crocus, Shanks introduces the
person Roger has been waiting for to his former

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.470
vice captain.

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:26.829
Now Crocus decided to stay behind because
he wanted to take care of Laboon.

00:15:26.829 --> 00:15:30.699
But with Rayleigh, I could absolutely see
him joining the red hair pirates to help with

00:15:30.699 --> 00:15:34.540
Luffy’s training and to make sure that he
ends up finding the one piece in order to

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:36.089
change the world.

00:15:36.089 --> 00:15:38.080
Which now brings us to the war at Marineford.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.610
Which does get really really interesting in
this scenario.

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:46.920
Now, even though Luffy and Ace never became
brothers, Ace still goes after Blackbeard,

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:51.600
he still gets captured and the war between
whitebeard and the marines is still bound

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.600
to happen.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:58.570
Only that this time, while Luffy is definitely
angry, he doesn’t have the same drive to

00:15:58.570 --> 00:15:59.870
go and save Ace.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:05.149
Instead, he accompanies Shanks to Wano, who
is trying to stop Kaido to get involved in

00:16:05.149 --> 00:16:08.100
the war as well.

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:11.660
This of course means that the prison break
in Impel down never happens.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:16.870
Which would mean that Jinbei stays in prison,
while Blackbeard and his crew are defeated

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.360
by Magellan when they try to invade the prison.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:23.610
But let’s assume that Blackbeard and his
crew mates actually manage to go down all

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:24.980
the way to level 6.

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:29.350
Because in that case, Blackbeard would once
again tell the level 6 prisoners that the

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:33.279
last person surviving in their cell could
join his crew.

00:16:33.279 --> 00:16:39.559
Which would mean that Jinbei would most likely
end up joining Blackbeards crew, even if it’s

00:16:39.559 --> 00:16:40.559
against his will.

00:16:40.559 --> 00:16:45.720
Now one big question is of course: How did
Shanks manage to stop Kaido from joining the

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.250
war?

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.500
Maybe the 2 crews actually fought.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:54.010
But when Shanks and his men arrive at Marineford
in the main storyline, they don’t look like

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.800
they just fought a gigantic dragon.

00:16:56.800 --> 00:17:01.830
So instead, I think it’s most likely that
Shanks actually just went and talked to Kaido.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:07.100
So while the two Yonko would have a meeting
in Onigashima, Luffy would surely run around

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:10.990
and finally run into none other than Yamato.

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:16.419
He tells Yamato about Ace being captured and
about his upcoming execution.

00:17:16.419 --> 00:17:20.709
And since Yamato is of course friends with
Ace, she wants to come and save him.

00:17:20.709 --> 00:17:26.750
As a result, Luffy secretly frees Yamato from
her shackles and smuggles her on board of

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:27.750
Shanks’ ship.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:29.510
They finally make it to Marineford.

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:33.590
But just like in the main story, it’s already
too late.

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:39.210
Ace has been killed and Blackbeard has gone
in and stolen Whitebeard’s devil fruit.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:42.620
Shanks once again is able to stop the war.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:46.610
This time Luffy is part of the epic intro
of the Red Hair Pirates.

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:51.710
He transforms into his awakened form and stands
between Aokiji and Marco.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:56.409
The Gorosei and many people who are watching
the live broadcast of the war are shocked

00:17:56.409 --> 00:17:58.570
at Luffy’s appearance.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:04.230
Sengoku after a quick moment of shock, announces
to the world that Luffy is the son of Monkey

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:09.160
D. Dragon, the world’s most wanted man and
and an officer of the red hair pirates.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:16.320
Luffy meanwhile, completely unfazed by all
this, has to stop Yamato from attacking Akainu

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.640
who is mocking Ace.

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:23.789
While Shanks is negotiating with Sengoku about
taking Ace’s and Whitebeard’s body’s,

00:18:23.789 --> 00:18:28.520
Luffy rushes to his Grandfather, who is heartbroken
about Ace’s death.

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:31.220
After the war, things could go in many different
directions.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:35.860
i could either see Luffy leaving Shanks’
crew to find his own path and crew.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:41.250
Or, Luffy stays with Shanks and soon overtakes
Ben Beckman as the second strongest man in

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.510
the crew and Shanks’ right hand man.

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:47.620
In that case, Shanks would most likely start
preparations to reach Laugh Tale soon and

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.090
make Luffy pirate king.

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:54.860
And a third alternative would be, that Luffy
passes on the straw hat to someone else, like

00:18:54.860 --> 00:19:01.789
Momonosuke, encouraging the next generation
to find the One Piece and change the world.

00:19:01.789 --> 00:19:06.799
But if you really want to go down a crazy
route, think about this: What if Luffy didn’t

00:19:06.799 --> 00:19:12.140
fight as part of Shank’s crew at Marineford,
what if he had fought next to Akainu, Kizaru

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:14.290
and Aokiji?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:18.180
What if instead of a pirate, Luffy had become
a Marine?

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:20.740
To find out, you can simply click right here.

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:22.260
Thanks for watching.

